/' 
Use Case Flows diagram for AI Revisor / Acclerk
Shows three main user flows:
1. Upload Invoice - upload and analyze invoices (paid or out-invoice)
2. Upload Transactions - CSV upload with complete replacement
3. Verify Workflow - connect invoices to transactions and verify matches
Focus on high-level concepts and status transitions
'/

@startuml

!define PRIMARY_COLOR #3B82F6
!define SECONDARY_COLOR #10B981
!define ACCENT_COLOR #F59E0B
!define DANGER_COLOR #EF4444
!define NEUTRAL_COLOR #6B7280
!define VERIFY_COLOR #8B5CF6

skinparam backgroundColor #F3F4F6
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

participant "User" as User #3B82F6
participant "Server" as Server #10B981
database "Database" as DB #F59E0B

== Flow 1: Upload Invoice ==

User -> User : Select invoice type\n(paid by us / out-invoice)
User -> Server : POST /upload\n(invoice file + type)
Server -> DB : Save invoice document
DB --> Server : OK
Server --> User : 200 OK

note right of DB #D1FAE5
  Status: **uploaded**
end note

Server -> Server : Trigger analysis\n(async)
Server -> DB : Update invoice\n(extracted data)

note right of DB #D1FAE5
  Status: **analyzed**
end note

...User sees invoice is analyzed...

== Flow 2: Upload Transactions ==

User -> Server : POST /upload-transactions\n(CSV file)
Server -> Server : Parse CSV
Server -> DB : DELETE previous transactions\n(for this user)
DB --> Server : OK
Server -> DB : INSERT new transactions\n(complete replacement)
DB --> Server : OK
Server --> User : 200 OK

note right of DB #FEF3C7
  Transactions fully replaced
  (upload = complete record)
end note

== Flow 3a: Connect Action ==

User -> Server : POST /transactions/connect
Server --> User : 200 OK (job started)

note left of User #E0E7FF
  Button disabled
  Loading indicator shown
end note

loop Every 5 seconds
  User -> Server : GET /transactions/connect/status
  alt Connection still running
    Server --> User : { running: true }
  else Connection complete
    Server --> User : { running: false }
  end
end

Server -> Server : Match invoices\nto transactions
Server -> DB : Update invoice statuses

note right of DB #F3E8FF
  Status: **to-verify**
  or **connection-fail**
end note

Server -> DB : Remove connection\nrun data

== Flow 3b: Verify Action ==

User -> Server : GET /invoices/:id
Server --> User : Invoice details +\nconnection info +\nanalysis data

note left of User #E0E7FF
  PDF preview shown
  Connection info displayed
  Analysis data shown
end note

User -> User : Review invoice\nCheck "verify" checkbox
User -> Server : PATCH /invoices/:id\n{ verified: true }
Server -> DB : Update invoice status

note right of DB #D1FAE5
  Status: **verified**
end note

Server --> User : 200 OK

note left of User #FEE2E2
  Can uncheck to revert
  Status returns to "to-verify"
end note

@enduml

